DESCRIPTION:Topic\nPhysical Activity - Zumba - Skyview Office DTI\nSynopsis
	\nZumba Session in physical capacity at Skyview Office\nSpeaker\nVishal Sa
	nnapuri (vishalsannapuri@dbs.com <mailto:vishalsannapuri@dbs.com> )\n \n\n
	\n________________________________________________________________________
	______________________________________\n\nOption 1 – If you are joining 
	via a laptop or mobile device through the application:\n1. Click on this h
	yperlink: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m655dd8
	27187d4e6efbfaf27d2d827375> \n2. Use a headset for a better experience\n*V
	isit here <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/SitePages/fow/digit
	al-tools.aspx?market=Singapore&category=Communication> to find out more ab
	out Webex \n\nMeeting password: SYbw6K3pd79 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 
	– If you are joining via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dia
	l in\n1. Press the "Call" icon\n2. Dial 25159949864@dbs.webex.com <mailto:
	25159949864@dbs.webex.com>  into the search bar and press "Call" \n3. If y
	ou are the host\, enter your 6-digit one-time Host KEY. Click here to see 
	how to retrieve your Host KEY <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW
	/Shared%20Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared
	%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx%2FU
	ser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D42f0%2Dbd84%2Db790
	e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx> \n
	\nOption 3 – If you are joining via a laptop through the Web browser: \n
	For external parties who do not wish to download the application \n1. Clic
	k on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?M
	TID=m655dd827187d4e6efbfaf27d2d827375> \n2. Click on ‘Cancel button’ i
	f a popup ‘Open Webex?' appears \n3. Click on ‘Join from your browser
	’ \n4. Enter your Name and Email Address and join the meeting \n\nClick 
	here <https://help.webex.com/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Join-a-Webex-Meeting#i
	d_135013> to find out more\n\nOption 4 – If you are dialling in via phon
	e (audio only):\n*Toll charges / Long distance charges may apply.\nNote if
	 you are the host\, please use either Option 1 or 2 to start the meeting.\
	nSingapore +65-3157-6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23> \nHong Kong +8
	52-3018-6828 <tel:%2B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Mumbai +91-22-6
	480-0114 <tel:%2B91-22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Hyderabad +91-40-
	6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +886-2-5594-0839 
	<tel:%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 2515 994 9864#\n
	Global call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php> \n\n\n
